'''''Malephora lutea''''' is a species of plants in the family [[Aizoaceae]] (stone plants). They are succulent plants. Flowers are visited by ''Fidelia kobrowi''.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Malephora lutea (Haw.) Schwant. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/3014017|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Malephora lutea (Rocky Point Ice Plant) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/AIZO/Malephora_lutea.php |access-date=2022-03-05 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

